desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "Struct scan: Python compile call"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python compile 调用"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-python-compile"
	risk: "code-injection"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到内置 compile()。配合 exec/eval 可执行动态代码。

### 风险类型
code-injection

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
不要 compile 外部字符串。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://c.py": <<<POS
def r(s):
    return compile(s, "<s>", "exec")

POS
	"safefile://s.py": <<<NEG
def r(s):
    return s.strip()

NEG
)

compile(* as $c) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Python compile call",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python compile 调用",
	message: "结构扫描：Python compile 调用",
	risk: "code-injection",
}
